    {
      "workload": "semi-structured",
      "label": "Semi-structured",
      "text": "Records that mostly share a shape but not entirely: logs, events, imported files and scraped data, where some fields are always present, others appear sometimes, and the whole lot has to be scanned and summarised.",
      "keywords": {
